{"content":[{"c":["BAAL-PERAZIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Location near Jerusalem of a battle in which Israel’s newly anointed King David defeated the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.5.20","r":"2Sam.5.20","rawR":"2Sam.5.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.5.20","value":"2Sam.5.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 5:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.14.11","r":"1Chr.14.11","rawR":"1Chr.14.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.14.11","value":"1Chr.14.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 14:11"},"). David named the area Baal-perazim to commemorate the Lord’s “breaking through” his enemies, since the phrase means the “lord of breaking through.” A prophetic reference to a Mt Perazim, where the Lord came “suddenly and in anger,” may recall David’s battle with the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.28.21","r":"Isa.28.21","rawR":"Isa.28.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.28.21","value":"Isa.28.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 28:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BaalPerazim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 5:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.5.20","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.5.20","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.5.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 14:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.14.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.14.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.14.11"},{"anchorText":"Is 28:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.28.21","rawQueryValue":"Isa.28.21","sourceRefExact":"Isa.28.21"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ed42a7d765c9cc11bf38514f05b912d506f03196c8dff4a8e5b0f786301e8c36","sourceItemName":"BaalPerazim","sourceItemOrder":18,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BaalPerazim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Baal-Perazim","title":"Baal-Perazim","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}